WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Your agents. One small window. Keep up with Claude Code and Codex
without another full-screen app.

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:06.500
Know what came back. Ready to check shows a short report.
Request history keeps the trail.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.250
Keep priorities at the top. Star the release notes.
They move to the front of the list.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.000
Keep priorities at the top. Star the release notes.
They move to the front of the list.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.750
Checked it? Clear the card. One click moves this round to Dealt with.
A new request brings it back.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.500
One project at a time. Separate conversations. Shared projects. Across both apps.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.250
Keep the goal in view. A project note reminds you what this work is for.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.000
Remember what you asked. One entry per request.
Your chain of thought, easy to find.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.750
Leave the next round a note. A To do reminder stays with the card
until you’re ready to pick it up.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.750
Less switching. More making. macOS · open source · local board
github.com/laurenceholt/kanbanana
